		"description": "<p dir=\"ltr\">Also at 3rd level, your choice of light or dark modifies in a literal sense how you see the world.</p><h3 dir=\"ltr\">Eyes of Light</h3><p dir=\"ltr\">If you choose Path of the Light, your eyes sharpen, allowing you to see like a hawk. You have advantage on Perception checks based on sight.</p><h3 dir=\"ltr\">Eye of Darkness</h3><p dir=\"ltr\">If you choose Path of Darkness, your vision can penetrate the most tenebrous gloom. Your darkvision can see through magical darkness as it it were normal darkness.</p>",
